"AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26548559618110450", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27571785269121208"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1513324836881754"}]}, "change_log": "# Lunar Lander VR \u2014 Release 1.3\n\n## What's New\n\n### Difficulty-Tuned Landing Speeds\n- Safe landing speed limits are now **per-difficulty** and checked independently on each axis:\n  - **Easy**: 3 m/s on Climb, Forward, and Lateral\n  - **Medium**: 2 m/s on all axes\n  - **Hard**: 1 m/s on all axes \u2014 precision required\n- Previously a single multiplier was applied to a base speed; now each difficulty has a fixed absolute limit.\n\n### HAG \u2014 Height Above Ground\n- The **ALT** cell on the Flight HUD is renamed to **HAG** (Height Above Ground), correctly describing what was always measured: a downward raycast to the nearest terrain surface, not barometric altitude.\n\n### Landing Pad System\n- New **LandingPad** script for scene-placed coloured landing zones.\n- Each pad has a configurable **Difficulty** and **Pad Color** (applied via `MaterialPropertyBlock` \u2014 no extra material instances).\n- Pad collision mirrors the difficulty-speed check; shows a labelled message on safe touchdown.\n", "created_date": 1777961173, "id": "26800117629621313", "version": "1.3.0", "version_code": 130, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}